---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<div class="box">
  <section class="skills">
    <div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
      <Icon
        icon="terminal-window"
        color="var(--accent-regular)"
        size="2.5rem"
        gradient
      />
      <h2>Code Conductor</h2>
      <p>
        <p>
          As the maestro of code, I lead full-stack projects like a Time Tressure, seamlessly blending front-end finesse with back-end brilliance. My expertise in the MERN stack ensures that every web and mobile app is a harmonious masterpiece, hitting all the right notes without missing a beat. Ready to turn your digital vision into a chart-topping success? Let’s make some beautiful music together!
        </p>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
      <Icon
        icon="trophy"
        color="var(--accent-regular)"
        size="2.5rem"
        gradient
      />
      <h2>Tech Tinkerer</h2>
      <p>
        In my tech lab, I’m the mad scientist mixing React & Next js with cutting-edge frameworks to concoct digital marvels. Whether it’s brewing up dazzling mobile apps or web solutions that dazzle, I’ve got the perfect recipe for turning your wildest ideas into stunning realities. Looking for a tech alchemist who makes innovation look easy? Step right up, and let’s create some magic!
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
      <Icon
        icon="strategy"
        color="var(--accent-regular)"
        size="2.5rem"
        gradient
      />
      <h2>Pixel Perfectionist</h2>
      <p>
        As a pixel perfectionist, I meticulously craft web and mobile designs with the precision of a master artisan. From 3D websites that captivate to animations that dance, I ensure every project is a visual delight and functions flawlessly. Because in my world, even pixels need their moment in the spotlight. Ready for a design that’s both breathtaking and functional? Let’s make your digital dreams come true!
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="tag-bubble">
    <div class="tagGIS">JavaScript</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">TypeScript</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">CSS</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">React</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Node.js</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Next.js</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Express</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">RESTful API</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">React Router</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">UI Design</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Editor.js</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Axios</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Redux</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Tailwind</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Three js</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Fire base</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Vite</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Fetch</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Figma</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">Shadcn</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">SEO/GA4</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">MongoDb</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">React Native</div>
    <div class="tagGIS">AWS</div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .skills-list {
    padding-top: 2em;
  }
  .box {
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .skills h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .skills p {
    color: var(--gray-400);
  }

  .tag-bubble {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 0.5em;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    text-wrap: balance;
    padding-top: 3em;
  }

  .tagGIS {
    background-color: var(--gray-900);
    border-radius: 100em;
    padding: 0.25em 1em;
    font-size: 1em;
    color: var(--gray-50);
  }

  @media (min-width: 50em) {
    .box {
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      padding: 2.5rem;
    }

    .skills {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 5rem;
    }

    .skills h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    }
  }
</style>
